; REFAC-128: the scaffold templates are data, not part of this Dune project.
;
; They are laid out exactly as `sol new` generates them, which means the tree
; contains files NAMED `dune` whose content is a template
; (`(library (name {{lib}}) ...)`) and cannot be parsed as Dune. Dune reads
; every `dune` file in the project, so without this stanza a `dune build` fails
; on the templates rather than on anything real.
;
; `data_only_dirs` keeps them out of the build while leaving them on disk for
; `sol new` to copy, and `(source_tree)` rules can still name them.
(data_only_dirs event fn svc worker workspace)
